usecaseDiagram
    actor Engineer
    actor Admin
    actor Machine
    
    Engineer --> (View Status)
    Engineer --> (Acknowledge Alert)
    Admin --> (Configure Thresholds)
    Machine --> (Ingest Telemetry)
    
    (Configure Thresholds) ..> (Authorize) : <<include>>
    (Ingest Telemetry) ..> (Validate Sensor Data) : <<include>>
    (Ingest Telemetry) ..> (Detect Anomaly and Alert) : <<extend>>
